WEBVTT

00:00:28.399 --> 00:00:30.568
[Sleeping with Science]

00:00:32.904 --> 00:00:36.074
For instance alcohol and THC,

00:00:36.074 --> 00:00:39.243
which is the psychoactive
component of cannabis,

00:00:39.243 --> 00:00:40.953
are all popular options.

00:00:41.162 --> 00:00:44.123
However, both THC and alcohol

00:00:44.123 --> 00:00:48.544
will ultimately make your insomnia
and your sleep difficulties worse,

00:00:48.544 --> 00:00:49.545
rather than better.

00:00:49.712 --> 00:00:53.257
Even melatonin will only increase
your sleep quality,

00:00:53.257 --> 00:00:55.718
or what we call your sleep efficiency,

00:00:55.718 --> 00:00:57.178
by just a few percent.

00:00:57.303 --> 00:00:58.596
Thankfully, however,

00:00:58.596 --> 00:01:02.391
there is a much more effective,
drug-free approach